<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle market not well tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said. Carcass basis steers and heifers were not well tested.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1275 lbs pt ld 107.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1175 lbs few 106.50-107.00.</p>
<p>Reported sales for Thurs: 100   Week to Date: 26,200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
